                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80 center-small">Dext is a global mid-market B2B SaaS company for accounting firms, bookkeepers, and businesses. Acquired by IRIS Software Group in December 2024, they saw record growth in 2025 and rolled out new features and beta programs, many of which needed product launch videos to support their 2026 Go-To-Market campaigns.</div>
