                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">Why us</span></h2>
                </div>
              </div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478537_2Frame-1707478537.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif 2400w" alt="A purple background with squares and dots" src="/images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-why_shoose">
